    "description": "Trace ServiceAccount selection, projected bound tokens and API authentication.",
    "assumption": "Default modern projected token integration; external cloud identity federation is separate.",
    "frames": [
      {
        "title": "Select a namespaced identity",
        "narration": "The Pod chooses pod-reader in its own namespace. That identity name does not itself specify permissions.",
